    "s1": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 220,
      "page": "sentence",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "Dana (requester) describes the prior-auth summarizer by switching phrases in one sentence. The healthcare-ai rules set the risk tier and review teams as she goes. Submit for review.",
      "w": 1440,
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300
    },
    "s2": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 220,
      "page": "sentence",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "Dana sees the result in plain words: high risk, 8 teams, due Sep 29. Triage and routing ran automatically; agents draft next; people sign; an approver decides.",
      "w": 1440,
      "x": 1520,
      "y": -300
    },
    "s3": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 220,
      "page": "sentence",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "Priya (privacy reviewer) opens Aegis to one sentence about what needs her. The case is waiting in her reviews.",
      "w": 1440,
      "x": 3040,
      "y": -300
    },
    "s4": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 220,
      "page": "sentence",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "Priya keeps or dismisses the agent's draft findings, then writes her decision as a sentence and picks her conditions. She signs; she doesn't approve.",
      "w": 1440,
      "x": 4560,
      "y": -300
    },
    "s5": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 220,
      "page": "sentence",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "Once all 8 teams have signed, Marcus (approver) reads what each said and decides in one sentence. He can't approve a case he submitted, and he must give a reason.",
      "w": 1440,
      "x": 6080,
      "y": -300
    },
    "s6": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 220,
      "page": "sentence",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "Later, Sam (auditor) asks who approved CASE-0142 and why. The answer is a sentence with the policy version, and the history is backed by the hash chain.",
      "w": 1440,
      "x": 7600,
      "y": -300
    },
    "sent": {
